      "roundness": null,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Why: stateless JWT (ADR-0002), there is no session to clear. Lowering JWT_EXPIRES_IN shrinks the window.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why: stateless JWT (ADR-0002), there is no session to clear. Lowering JWT_EXPIRES_IN shrinks the window.",
